.TH swarm-key-backup 1  "swarm 0.2.2" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-key\-backup \- Copy a repo signing key to FILE with mode 0600
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm key backup\fR <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR> [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREPO\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Copy a repo signing key to FILE with mode 0600
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<FILE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREPO\fR>

